{"unit_id":"FABAGV__dsh-prompt-adapt#card-zh","repo":"FABAGV/dsh-prompt-adapt","commit":"8e67b53753acdb7d490b1657d7133222f6818eb0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-adapt 是面向 DSH Web 设置界面的提示适配插件。它从本机历史会话中筛选可学习内容，按触发条件生成并更新用户画像，再将当前画像按预算注入系统提示；用户也可切换到互斥的自定义提示词模式并在设置页编辑、复制文本。界面还提供人格、技能和会话管理入口，宿主将画像状态保存在 DSH_HOME 下，适合希望 AI 延续个人偏好和协作习惯的 DSH 用户。使用前无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:598-636","lib/index.js:1798-1807","lib/client.js:3799-3815"]}
{"unit_id":"FABAGV__dsh-prompt-adapt#card-en","repo":"FABAGV/dsh-prompt-adapt","commit":"8e67b53753acdb7d490b1657d7133222f6818eb0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-prompt-adapt is a DSH Web settings plugin that summarizes local session history into a user profile and injects it into the system prompt within a budget. Users can instead edit a custom prompt. It also exposes profile, persona, and skill controls; state is stored under DSH_HOME.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:598-636","lib/index.js:1798-1807","lib/client.js:3799-3815"]}
